       </property>
       <property name="toolTip">
        <string>i3's hide_edge_borders. none: the frame all round. vertical: not the left and right sides of a window at the output's edge (with no gap between windows); horizontal: not the top and bottom; both: neither. smart: no frame on a window alone on its workspace; smart_no_gaps: the same, only without edge gaps. A hidden side leaves the frame's width empty (KWin's tiles).</string>
       </property>
