     <item row="30" column="0">
      <widget class="QLabel" name="forWindowLabel">
       <property name="text">
        <string>Rules (for_window):</string>
       </property>
       <property name="buddy">
        <cstring>kcfg_forWindow</cstring>
       </property>
      </widget>
     </item>
     <item row="30" column="1">
      <widget class="QPlainTextEdit" name="kcfg_forWindow">
       <property name="kcfg_property" stdset="0">
        <cstring>plainText</cstring>
       </property>
       <property name="toolTip">
        <string>i3's for_window rules, one per line (or separated by ;): [criteria] floating enable, or floating disable. Criteria: class, instance, title, window_role, window_type (normal, dialog, utility, toolbar, splash, notification), workspace (the number), floating, tiling, all; each a regular expression in quotes, all in one rule must match. Each rule runs at most once per window, when it opens or changes title or class. Example: [class="^org\.kde\.kate$" title="Find"] floating enable</string>
       </property>
       <property name="maximumBlockCount">
        <number>200</number>
       </property>
       <property name="minimumSize">
        <size>
         <width>360</width>
         <height>96</height>
