       <property name="toolTip">
        <string>i3's tiling_drag: which presses drag a tiling window to a new place in the layout (plugins). modifier: Meta+left anywhere in it. titlebar: a left press on its title bar. modifier titlebar: both. off: neither (a tiling window stays put).</string>
