       <property name="text">
        <string>New windows in fullscreen:</string>
       </property>
       <property name="buddy">
        <cstring>kcfg_popupDuringFullscreen</cstring>
       </property>
      </widget>
     </item>
     <item row="43" column="1">
      <widget class="QComboBox" name="kcfg_popupDuringFullscreen">
       <property name="kcfg_property" stdset="0">
        <cstring>currentText</cstring>
       </property>
       <property name="toolTip">
        <string>i3's popup_during_fullscreen: on a workspace with a fullscreen window, a new window opens behind it and the fullscreen window keeps the focus. smart: except the fullscreen window's own dialogs, which show over it. ignore: no exception (save the fullscreen window's own modal dialogs: KWin activates those in its place). leave_fullscreen: any dialog ends the fullscreen instead. all: any floating window shows over it. A window that opens fullscreen itself always takes over.</string>
       </property>
       <item>
        <property name="text">
         <string>smart</string>
        </property>
       </item>
       <item>
        <property name="text">
         <string>ignore</string>
        </property>
       </item>
       <item>
        <property name="text">
         <string>leave_fullscreen</string>
        </property>
       </item>
       <item>
        <property name="text">
         <string>all</string>
        </property>
       </item>
      </widget>
     </item>
